        <li>You want a route that can later connect to law, psychology, design, media, civil services, policy, teaching, or communication-heavy work.</li>
        <li>You understand that future success will still depend on skills, not stream label alone.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--gold">
