      <div class="compare-card__label">Diploma fits when</div>
      <ul>
        <li>You already lean technical and want applied learning to start earlier.</li>
        <li>You prefer labs, systems, tools, and practical work over waiting for a broad academic route.</li>
        <li>You are ready to judge institute quality seriously before joining.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--gold">
      <div class="compare-card__label">Diploma becomes risky when</div>
      <ul>
        <li>You join only because the nearest institute had a seat.</li>
        <li>You never verify labs, faculty reality, fees, or later route progression.</li>
        <li>You assume technical labels alone guarantee employability.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Diploma can be a smart route.
  </p>

